# Find A Crib growth engine. Installed at /etc/cron.d/rentmap-growth.
#
# This droplet (142.93.183.172, Find A Crib only since 2026-10-06) keeps per-project crons in /etc/cron.d/, NOT in
# root's user crontab — never pipe to `crontab -` here, it clobbers the other
# sites' jobs. Edit this tracked copy and scp it into place; do not hand-edit
# the file on the box, or the repo and the droplet drift apart silently.
#
# Runs from the git checkout at /root/Find-A-Crib so the daily cloud review agent
# (which has only the repo) can steer it: it pushes ledger and code changes,
# growth_run.sh pulls them in and pushes results back.
#
# 05:40 UTC — rebuild the daily pages from the overnight voucher feed (04:15 UTC),
# deploy them, and submit new URLs to IndexNow.
#
# Deliberately above the CRON_TZ line: this one is pinned to the voucher feed's
# UTC clock, not to the business day, so it must NOT pick up America/New_York.
SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin
#PAUSED-20261107 40 5 * * * scraper fac-run supabase,smtp,gsc -- /root/Find-A-Crib/pipeline/growth_run.sh build --deploy >> /var/log/rentmap-growth.log 2>&1

# 05:00 America/New_York — measure, judge, prune, scout, draft outreach. Deliberately
# an hour before the 6am review agent, so the agent always reads fresh numbers.
CRON_TZ=America/New_York
#PAUSED-20261107 0 5 * * * scraper fac-run supabase,smtp,gsc -- /root/Find-A-Crib/pipeline/growth_run.sh daily >> /var/log/rentmap-growth.log 2>&1

# The internal growth report email (Fridays 06:00, `growth_run.sh report`) was
# turned OFF 2026-11-06 at the owner's request ("i dont need this report
# anymore"). The 05:00 run still measures and writes the ledger, the console
# report and reports/waiting-on-you.html; only the email is gone. To send one
# by hand: growth_run.sh report --email <address>.

# 07:30 America/New_York on the 1st — are AI chatbots sending people here?
# growth/ai_visibility.py: five renter questions to Claude with web search
# (~$1/month, priced into api_spend), Search Console for Gemini, our own
# analytics for ChatGPT. Mails the owner; one line per month in
# growth/ai_visibility.jsonl. Owner, 2026-10-29.
#PAUSED-20261107 30 7 1 * * scraper cd /root/Find-A-Crib && fac-run anthropic,supabase,smtp,gsc,owner -- /opt/findacrib/venv/bin/python -m growth.ai_visibility >> /var/log/rentmap-growth.log 2>&1
